##Armor bar
execute as @a[scores={usercfg=13}] run function lem.battle:clientconfig/armorbar/enable
execute as @a[scores={usercfg=14}] run function lem.battle:clientconfig/armorbar/disable

##Enchanted armor swapping
execute as @a[scores={usercfg=23}] run function lem.battle:clientconfig/swapenchanted/enable
execute as @a[scores={usercfg=24}] run function lem.battle:clientconfig/swapenchanted/disable
